**Result:** Blame games, slow releases, 3am pages

---

# DevOps Philosophy

## Breaking down the wall

**DevOps is NOT:**

- A job title
- A tool you can buy
- Just CI/CD

**DevOps IS:**

- A culture of shared responsibility
- Automation mindset: "If you do it twice, automate it"
- Fast feedback loops: fail fast, learn fast

**The DevOps mantra:**

> "You build it, you run it." - Werner Vogels, Amazon CTO

---

# The DevOps Lifecycle

```mermaid +render
flowchart TB
    PLAN["Plan"] --> CODE["Code"]
    CODE --> BUILD["Build"]
    BUILD --> TEST["Test"]
    TEST --> RELEASE["Release"]
    RELEASE --> DEPLOY["Deploy"]
    DEPLOY --> OPERATE["Operate"]
    OPERATE --> MONITOR["Monitor"]
    MONITOR --> PLAN

    style PLAN fill:#f9f,stroke:#333
    style MONITOR fill:#f9f,stroke:#333
```

**Key insight:** It's a loop, not a line

**Old way:** Plan -> Code -> ... -> Deploy -> Done!

**DevOps way:** Continuous improvement, continuous feedback

